  <Tagline>k__BackingField: The full game. Buy, build, bankrupt everyone.
  <Description>k__BackingField: 'The official rules. Buy what you land on or it goes to auction. Collect rent, doubled on a full color set, and build evenly: the bank has 32 houses and 12 hotels. Mortgage to raise cash, trade to complete sets. Doubles roll again, three doubles go to jail. The last player standing wins.'
